  "description": "Here is a 5-line summary of the conversation:\n\n1. The task involved updating the `WorkspaceSettings.vue` component to source available users from a Vuex/Storex store instead of a prop.\n2. The `availableUsers` prop was removed and replaced with an `allUsers` computed property reading from `$storex.users.allUsers`.\n3. An `availableUsersToAdd` computed property filters out already-added users from the dropdown list.\n4. A `workspaceUserIds` computed property was added to safely handle workspaces that may not have a `user_ids` array.\n5. All other existing functionality, including project association, app management, and role toggling, remained unchanged.",
